WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:09.680
This is our town Saint Paul, Minnesota&nbsp;
USA. Located halfway between the equator&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:14.720
and the north pole with no large bodies of&nbsp;
water nearby to check extreme temperatures&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:19.920
and no protective mountain ranges to ward off heat&nbsp;
and cold saint paul lights have learned to live&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:25.520
with the distinct seasonal changes traditional&nbsp;
in a temperate climate winters here are cold with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:31.040
plenty of ice and snow the clear bright days and&nbsp;
the thrill of winter sports more than compensate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:37.440
for any inconvenience brought about by blustery&nbsp;
weather summers are marked by periods of bright&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:43.840
warm sun and cooling showers when we appreciate&nbsp;
our abundance of summer recreational facilities&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:50.320
to combat these extremes in climate we have&nbsp;
at our disposal a wide choice of clothing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:55.360
for thousands of years man has&nbsp;
steadily improved upon his apparel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.360 --> 00:01:00.560
weaving sewing and inventing new fabrics to keep&nbsp;
his body free from the effects of heat and coal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:06.400
through many centuries he relied on animal&nbsp;
skins and furs and cloth woven from living&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:12.960
fibers nowadays these age-old methods have&nbsp;
been supplemented by man-made synthetics it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:18.080
important that saint paul lights be accurately&nbsp;
informed about weather conditions newspapers radio&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:24.480
television and other communications make weather&nbsp;
reporting a part of their daily schedule everyone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:29.440
young and old alike is interested in what the&nbsp;
weather will be it's a vital part of our lives for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:35.280
weather forecasting tells us what to wear how to&nbsp;
dress this afternoon tonight or tomorrow morning

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:42.480
whether there'll be rain or snow is something&nbsp;
mother must know every day of the year&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:49.040
so the children will be prepared cold st&nbsp;
paul winters call for the warmest sweaters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:55.360
coats and gloves to keep young bodies healthy&nbsp;
in and out of doors winter brings with it many&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:59.680
hazards which must be guarded against by&nbsp;
the best our clothing industry has to offer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:07.840
comfortable lightweight garments designed to&nbsp;
provide freedom of movement and utmost warmth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:12.960
saint paul's global position&nbsp;
at 40 degrees north latitude&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:17.840
creates our climate of extremes during the&nbsp;
winter we're tilted away from the sun and receive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:24.080
only its reflected rays these long slanted rays&nbsp;
are not strong nor abundant enough to be absorbed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:28.240
and we find ourselves with many months of&nbsp;
low temperatures and snow-covered streets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:35.840
but adequate clothing permits us to enjoy&nbsp;
ourselves even in the midst of winter's grip&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:41.200
in summer we bear the direct rays of the&nbsp;
sun which cause our warmest temperatures&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:46.560
but being a people fond of the outdoors&nbsp;
we found ways to escape the heat of summer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:52.000
present-day summer clothing is a far cry from&nbsp;
the swimsuits of 1910 in those days the body&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:56.960
was intended to be covered social behavior&nbsp;
cared little for comfort and clothing was not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:03.840
