all kinds were restricted by cumbersome styles

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:15.920
only during the last forty years or so have&nbsp;
people begun to enjoy the benefits of sensible&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:20.640
